<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>New Organization Registration</title>

    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        color: #000000;
      }

      .email-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 30px 0;
      }

      .outer-container {
        max-width: 880px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        border: 1px solid #d5eeee;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 18px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .container {
        background-color: #f6fbfb;
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 28px 48px 34px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .accent-row {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        font-size: 0;
        line-height: 0;
      }

      .accent {
        display: inline-block;
        height: 7px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin-right: 6px;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .accent.teal {
        width: 135px;
        background-color: #5fa6a6;
      }

      .accent.orange {
        width: 42px;
        background-color: #f26543;
      }

      .accent.purple {
        width: 42px;
        background-color: #969be8;
      }

      h1 {
        color: #2f6f72;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 27px;
        line-height: 1.3;
        margin: 0 0 28px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      p {
        color: #000000;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.45;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
      }

      strong {
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .details-box {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #d5eeee;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 20px 24px;
        margin: 20px 0 24px;
      }

      .detail-row {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }

      .detail-row:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .detail-label {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #2f6f72;
      }

      .divider {
        border: none;
        border-top: 1px solid #d5eeee;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }

      .signature p {
        margin: 0 0 4px;
      }

      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 36px;
      }

      .footer p {
        color: #2f6f72;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.4;
        margin: 0 0 4px;
      }

      @media only screen and (max-width: 700px) {
        .email-wrapper {
          padding: 14px 0;
        }

        .outer-container {
          max-width: 94%;
          padding: 10px;
          border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .container {
          padding: 22px 20px 28px;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 23px;
          white-space: normal;
        }

        p,
        .detail-row {
          font-size: 15px;
        }

        .accent.teal {
          width: 120px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class='email-wrapper'>
      <div class='outer-container'>
        <div class='container'>

          <div class='accent-row'>
            <span class='accent teal'></span>
            <span class='accent orange'></span>
            <span class='accent purple'></span>
          </div>

          <h1>New Organization Registration</h1>

          <p>Hello Team,</p>

          <p>
            Great news—we have a new childcare organization joining the Stutris family!
          </p>

          <p>
            Please begin the onboarding process for the following customer:
          </p>

          <div class='details-box'>
            <div class='detail-row'>
              <span class='detail-label'>Organization:</span>
              {{organizationName}}
            </div>
            <div class='detail-row'>
              <span class='detail-label'>Primary Contact:</span>
              {{contactName}}
            </div>
            <div class='detail-row'>
              <span class='detail-label'>Email:</span>
              {{email}}
            </div>
            <div class='detail-row'>
              <span class='detail-label'>Phone:</span>
              {{phone}}
            </div>
            <div class='detail-row'>
              <span class='detail-label'>Subscription Plan:</span>
              {{plan}}
            </div>
          </div>

          <p>
            Our goal is to have every new customer fully configured and confident using Stutris before their scheduled
            go-live date.
          </p>

          <p>
            Thank you for continuing to provide an exceptional onboarding experience. Every successful implementation
            helps childcare programs optimize enrollment, protect revenue, and ensure every child is in their perfect
            spot.
          </p>

          <hr class='divider' />

          <div class='signature'>
            <p><strong>— Stutris Operations</strong></p>
          </div>

          <div class='footer'>
            <p>Stutris &mdash; Smarter Roster Planning</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>